# Integration image for the user's T-Display P4: one 9 MB factory slot
# (boards/partitions_16m.csv) because SSH client + LTE + Ethernet + bc
# do not fit a 4.5 MB OTA slot. Storage stays at 0x910000 and NVS at
# 0x9000, so a full install keeps settings and the storage image.
CONFIG_PARTITION_TABLE_CUSTOM_FILENAME="boards/partitions_16m.csv"
